        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: LZR Racer, competitive swimwear\n- Companies: Speedo\n- Materials: woven elastane-nylon, polyurethane\n- Topics: aquatic sports, swimming apparel\n\nFacts:\n- Competitive swimwear refers to swimsuits, clothing, equipment, and accessories used in aquatic sports such as swimming, diving, synchronized swimming, triathlon, and water polo.\n- The LZR Racer is a line of competition swimsuits manufactured by Speedo.\n- The name LZR Racer is pronounced like \"laser.\"\n- Speedo makes the LZR Racer using a high-technology swimwear fabric composed of woven elastane-nylon and polyurethane.",
